START

Initialize a random policy π(s) for all states

REPEAT

    // Policy Evaluation
    REPEAT
        For each state s:
            V(s) = R(s, π(s)) + γ × V(next_state)
    UNTIL values converge

    // Policy Improvement
    policy_stable = TRUE

    FOR each state s:
        old_action = π(s)

        Select action with maximum value:
            π(s) = argmax [R(s,a) + γV(next_state)]

        IF old_action ≠ π(s):
            policy_stable = FALSE

    END FOR

UNTIL policy_stable = TRUE

Display optimal policy

STOP
